@host = http://localhost:5080

### List all employees
GET {{host}}/api/employees

### Get one employee
GET {{host}}/api/employees/1

### Create an employee
POST {{host}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Julia Steiner",
  "timeBalanceHours": -12.5,
  "remainingVacationDays": 9,
  "vacationStartDate": "2026-08-10",
  "managerInformed": false,
  "handoverCompleted": false
}

### Update an employee
PUT {{host}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Anna Gruber",
  "timeBalanceHours": 12.5,
  "remainingVacationDays": 18,
  "vacationStartDate": "2026-08-01",
  "managerInformed": true,
  "handoverCompleted": true
}

### Delete an employee
DELETE {{host}}/api/employees/6

### Readiness for all employees
GET {{host}}/api/readiness

### Readiness for one employee
GET {{host}}/api/readiness/2

### Preview readiness for unsaved data
POST {{host}}/api/readiness/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Preview",
  "timeBalanceHours": -30,
  "remainingVacationDays": 4,
  "vacationStartDate": "2026-07-28",
  "managerInformed": false,
  "handoverCompleted": false
}

### Health (overall)
GET {{host}}/health

### Health (liveness)
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Health (readiness, touches the database)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Explicit API version (the default is 1.0)
GET {{host}}/api/employees
X-Api-Version: 1.0

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Authentication. Run the login request first, then paste the
### accessToken from the response into @token below.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
@token = paste-the-access-token-here

### Sign in
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@timeready.local",
  "password": "Admin#Demo2026"
}

### Current account
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh the token pair
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "paste-the-refresh-token-here"
}

### Sign out (revokes the refresh token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "paste-the-refresh-token-here"
}

### Any employee request now needs the header
GET {{host}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Audit trail (Admin only)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Latest changes
GET {{host}}/api/audit?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Only updates, made by a given user, in a date range
GET {{host}}/api/audit?action=Updated&user=admin@timeready.local&from=2026-07-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change history of one employee
GET {{host}}/api/audit/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A single audit entry
GET {{host}}/api/audit/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Audit retention and archive (Admin only)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Policy, job status and table sizes
GET {{host}}/api/audit/retention
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Apply the policy now instead of waiting for the next tick
POST {{host}}/api/audit/retention/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search the archive
GET {{host}}/api/audit/archive?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archived changes of one employee
GET {{host}}/api/audit/archive?entityName=Employee&entityId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
